{
    desc => 'di[ deletes text inside square brackets',
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/text_object_di_bracket`

Tests the `di[` text object which deletes text inside square brackets
while preserving the brackets themselves.

**initial.png** — Cursor on '1' inside the brackets at line 1 col 12.

Keys: `di[`

**after_di_bracket.png** — Content between `[` and `]` is deleted.
